  "guarantees": {
    "transactional": "The state transition and audit event commit in one durable transaction; an audit failure aborts the transition.",
    "durable-before-stream": "The access identity is persisted before a governed stream can release bytes. A later completion event may be best-effort.",
    "best-effort": "The operation may complete before the audit append. The producer logs a structured failure and does not undo the completed operation.",
    "mixed": "The producer owns operation families with different guarantees; each operation-level TypeSpec contract remains authoritative."
  },
